      "type": "text",
      "text": "Small ulcers: moxifloxacin 0.5% or gatifloxacin 0.3–0.5%. Larger or central ulcers: fortified tobramycin 15 mg/mL + cefazolin 50 mg/mL. Dose often at first (eg, q15 min × 4, then hourly around the clock)"
